omp-web (0.3.3) jammy; urgency=medium

  * debian/rules: isolate the next build into an empty HOME/XDG so
    "collecting page data" never reads the runner's real ~/.omp/agent
    (fleet machine registry + provider config) and makes live network
    calls that intermittently hang the build; also disable Next.js
    telemetry. Bun/omp keep their absolute runner paths (refs #25).

